  "description": "Qwen3.7-Max is the largest-scale and most comprehensively capable model in the Qwen3.7 series, currently open for experience with its text-only capabilities. Qwen3.7 is a new-generation flagship model designed for the agentic era, with its core strengths lying in the breadth and depth of its agentic capabilities: it excels at a wide range of tasks across programming, office and productivity work, and long-horizon autonomous execution.",
